@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/personas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificacion": "2001", "nombres": "Sofía", "apellidos": "Ramírez", "edad": 30, "genero": "Femenino" }

### Get by id
GET {{host}}/api/personas/2001

### List everyone (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/personas?page=1&pageSize=10

### List women (VW_Mujeres view, paged)
GET {{host}}/api/personas/mujeres?page=1&pageSize=10

### Update age
PATCH {{host}}/api/personas/2001/edad
Content-Type: application/json

{ "edad": 31 }

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/personas/2001
